'''''Iochroma fuchsioides'''''  is an ''[[Iochroma]]'' species found in [[Ecuador]] and [[Colombia]]. It was first described in 1848.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.tropicos.org/Name/29605037|title= Iochroma fuchsioides in Tropicos}}</ref> In addition to the known withanolide D {1}, three new withanolides have been isolated from ''Iochroma fuchsioides''.<ref>{{Cite journal|last=Raffauf|first=Robert F.|last2=Shemluck|first2=Melvin J.|last3=Le Quesne|first3=Philip W.|date=November 1991|title=The Withanolides of Iochroma fuchsioides|journal=Journal of Natural Products|language=EN|volume=54|issue=6|pages=1601–1606|doi=10.1021/np50078a017|issn=0163-3864}}</ref>

